{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Are your information leakage prevention measures sufficient? It will be too late after an incident occurs!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"As cloud shift progresses, diversifying database access management is causing confusion in internal security"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Many security threats focus on external attacks, and internal threats are not so much focused"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"on, but there are many accidents and incidents such as information leakage. In reality, there are many risks internally"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In this seminar, we will introduce QueryPie's solution, which focuses on measures against internal risks"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The target audience is security professionals. It is an especially effective seminar for those interested in preventing database tampering"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"and data leakage."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Webinar Information]"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Date: December 18, 2024"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Time: 15:00 – 15:45"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Format: Online (Zoom)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Important Notes for Participation]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Venue opening time"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"14:50"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cancellation"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Please contact us at the email address below."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"mailto:jp-sales@querypie.com","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"jp-sales@querypie.com"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We look forward to seeing you at the webinar!"}]}]}